                        <!-- Section 2: Module Permission Groups (aspnet_usergroup) -->
                        <div class="col-12 mt-4"><h6 class="fw-bold text-muted border-bottom pb-2 mb-2 small">2. Module Permission Groups (aspnet_usergroup)</h6></div>

